---
/* Case studies hub matching Claude Design “Case Studies.dc.html” layout:
   three “ways in” with full-width featured stories (Rewired, Honest Hank’s, Dry Duck).
   Motha is not featured. Hooked Up + other logos sit in the “also flying” strip.
   Stats/copy come from brain-dump case pages, not the design mock figures. */
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Picture from '../../components/Picture.astro';
import { absoluteUrl, breadcrumbList, graph, webPageNode } from '../../data/schema';

const alsoFlying = [
  { name: 'logo-hooked-up', alt: 'Hooked Up Electric', href: '/case-studies/hooked-up', h: 34 },
  { name: 'logo-motha', alt: 'Motha Electric', href: '/blog/google-category-relevance', h: 32, radius: true },
  { name: 'logo-coastal-current', alt: 'Coastal Current', h: 34 },
  { name: 'logo-pacific', alt: 'Pacific Home Electric', h: 32 },
  { name: 'logo-definite', alt: 'Definite Electric', h: 32 },
  { name: 'logo-austral', alt: 'Austral Energy', h: 32, radius: true },
  { name: 'logo-c-tinting', alt: 'C Tinting', h: 34 },
];

// Featured cards sit side by side above 900px, so half the shell width.
const FEATURE_SIZES = '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 640px';

const title = 'Home Service Case Studies and Results | Local Service Rocket';
const description =
  "Real Google growth stories: scale what you have (Rewired), grow the crew (Honest Hank's), or start from nothing (Dry Duck). Pick the path that looks like yours.";
const pageUrl = absoluteUrl('/case-studies/');
const jsonLd = graph([
  webPageNode({ pageUrl, name: title, description }),
  breadcrumbList(pageUrl, [
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Case Studies', path: '/case-studies' },
  ]),
]);
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <main class="cs-index">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="intro">
        <div class="eyebrow">CASE STUDIES</div>
        <h1>Three ways in.</h1>
        <p>
          Wherever you’re starting from, someone here started there too. Pick the story that looks
          like yours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 1 · Scale what you have -->
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">1</div>
        <h2>Scale what you have</h2>
        <div class="section-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <a href="/case-studies/rewired" class="feature">
        <Picture
          name="team-rewired"
          alt="The Rewired team and fleet"
          class="feature-media"
          sizes={FEATURE_SIZES}
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="feature-body">
          <div class="brand-row">
            <div class="logo-box">
              <Picture name="logo-rewired" alt="" height={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="brand-name">Rewired</div>
              <div class="brand-meta">Electrical · Des Moines, IA</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            John had burned through multiple agencies that never made ads work. We got Google
            producing on a scuffed setup, stayed through the rebuild detours, then owned site, SEO,
            ads, and hiring. Years later he’s still a client, with a much larger Des Moines crew and
            high six-figure months.
          </p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div>
              <div class="stat accent">$60k → $220k+</div>
              <div class="stat-label">avg monthly revenue</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">5 → 12</div>
              <div class="stat-label">crew</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">1.5 → 6</div>
              <div class="stat-label">avg booked calls / day</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="more">Read the Rewired story →</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 2 · Grow the crew -->
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">2</div>
        <h2>Grow the crew</h2>
        <div class="section-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <a href="/case-studies/honest-hanks" class="feature reverse">
        <div class="feature-body">
          <div class="brand-row">
            <div class="logo-box">
              <Picture name="logo-honest-hanks" alt="" height={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="brand-name">Honest Hank's</div>
              <div class="brand-meta">Electrician · Tampa, FL</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            Lewis wasn’t starting from zero skill. He needed a company that looked and ran like one.
            Referred by Rewired, we stacked small Google wins first (profile, LSAs, conversion
            basics), then brand, website, vans, and hiring only after lead flow paid for the next
            step. No bet-the-shop setup package.
          </p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div>
              <div class="stat accent">$25k → $80k</div>
              <div class="stat-label">avg monthly revenue</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">1 → 3</div>
              <div class="stat-label">techs</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">3rd van</div>
              <div class="stat-label">wrapped and rolling</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="more">Read the Honest Hank's story →</div>
        </div>
        <Picture
          name="team-honest-hanks"
          alt="Honest Hank's team"
          class="feature-media hanks"
          sizes={FEATURE_SIZES}
        />
      </a>

      <!-- 3 · Start from nothing -->
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">3</div>
        <h2>Start from nothing</h2>
        <div class="section-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <a href="/case-studies/dry-duck" class="feature">
        <Picture
          name="team-dry-duck"
          alt="Dry Duck team"
          class="feature-media"
          sizes={FEATURE_SIZES}
        />
        <div class="feature-body">
          <div class="brand-row">
            <div class="logo-box">
              <Picture name="logo-dry-duck" alt="" height={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="brand-name">Dry Duck</div>
              <div class="brand-meta">Basement waterproofing · Iowa</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            The company didn’t exist. Brand idea, site, and Google profile launched on starter
            economics, then survived the classic new-brand month-two cliff. Organic came back, ads
            layered on, and the shop scaled toward $200k months with a real crew, SEO first, ads
            later.
          </p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div>
              <div class="stat accent">$0 → $200k</div>
              <div class="stat-label">monthly revenue</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">0 → 5</div>
              <div class="stat-label">full-time staff</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="stat">6 mo</div>
              <div class="stat-label">to serious scale</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="more">Read the Dry Duck story →</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="also">
        <div class="also-label">ALSO FLYING WITH US</div>
        <div class="also-logos">
          {
            alsoFlying.map((logo) =>
              logo.href ? (
                <a href={logo.href} class="also-logo" title={logo.alt}>
                  <Picture
                    name={logo.name}
                    alt={logo.alt}
                    height={logo.h}
                    style={`height:${logo.h}px;${logo.radius ? 'border-radius:6px;' : ''}`}
                  />
                </a>
              ) : (
                <span class="also-logo" title={logo.alt}>
                  <Picture
                    name={logo.name}
                    alt={logo.alt}
                    height={logo.h}
                    style={`height:${logo.h}px;${logo.radius ? 'border-radius:6px;' : ''}`}
                  />
                </span>
              )
            )
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-panel">
        <div>
          <div class="cta-title">Which way in is yours?</div>
          <p>Start at about $500/month. No sales calls, watch how it works and decide.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/get-started" class="btn btn-primary">Get started →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cs-index {
    padding: 56px 0 72px;
  }

  .intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .section-num {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--hairline);
  }

  .feature {
    margin-top: 18px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .feature.reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr;
  }

  .feature:hover {
    border-color: var(--orange);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* :global() because <Picture> renders these images from a child component. */
  :global(.feature-media) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 300px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  :global(.feature-media.hanks) {
    object-position: center 60%;
  }

  .feature-body {
    padding: 32px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .brand-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .logo-box {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #f6f6f8;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
  }

  .logo-box :global(img) {
    max-width: 28px;
    max-height: 28px;
    display: block;
  }

  .brand-name {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .brand-meta {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
  }

  .feature-body > p {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--body);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .stat.accent {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .more {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .also {
    margin-top: 44px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .also-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted-3);
  }

  .also-logos {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .also-logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    filter: grayscale(1);
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition: opacity 0.15s, filter 0.15s;
  }

  a.also-logo:hover {
    filter: none;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .also-logo :global(img) {
    width: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .cta-panel {
    margin-top: 48px;
    background: var(--dark);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    color: var(--dark-text);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .cta-panel p {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--dark-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .feature,
    .feature.reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .feature.reverse :global(.feature-media) {
      order: -1;
    }

    :global(.feature-media) {
      min-height: 220px;
      max-height: 280px;
    }

    .feature-body {
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }

    .stats {
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
